		(property "Notes" "VCAP_1: plain 4.7uF X5R MLCC fitted (C1779, same BOM line as C12), decided 2026-08-15. DS11853 Table 19's 0.1-0.2 ohm ESR window is contradicted by ST's own practice: AN4661 calls the same part 'ceramic', every ST board fits plain MLCCs (Nucleo-64 MB1136 single-VCAP: 4.7uF ceramic 'ESR<1ohm'; Nucleo-144 MB1137/F722ZE: 2.2uF X7R), and newer families spec ESR as a maximum (H7 <100mR, U5 <20mR). Known deviation from the datasheet letter; no field failure ever reported."
			(at 167.64 177.8 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
